cache:query:what is the story of adam and eve
$695
Adam was created by God in his own likeness as a male and female, and God named the man “Adam” (Genesis 5:1‑2)【chunk-55】.  In the garden Adam and his wife were naked but felt no shame (Genesis 2:25)【chunk-27】.  

The serpent deceived them, leading to the first fall; as a result they were punished and a promise of a future Redeemer was given (Genesis 3)【chunk-27】.  After the fall God cast Adam out of the garden and placed cherubim with a flaming, ever‑turning sword to guard the way to the tree of life (Genesis 3:24)【chunk-41】.  

Adam and Eve later had children, the first two being Cain, a husbandman, and Abel, a shepherd (Genesis 4:1‑2)【chunk-41】.
$4
