cache:query:what is the story of cain
$626
Cain and Abel were the first two sons of Adam and Eve. Abel was a shepherd and Cain a farmer【chunk-41】. Cain killed Abel, and when the Lord asked him where his brother was, Cain replied, “I know not; am I my brother’s keeper?” The Lord then said that the voice of Abel’s blood cried out from the earth and cursed Cain to be “cursed upon the earth” for the murder【chunk-45】. After the deed Cain was driven out and became a fugitive, dwelling “on the east side of Eden”【chunk-49】. Later he knew his wife, they had a son named Henoch, and Cain built a city named after his son【chunk-49】.
$4
