cache:query:what is the story of adam and eve
$595
Adam was created by God “in the likeness of God,” male and female, and was blessed and named Adam on the day of his creation【chunk-55】.  He and his wife Eve were naked and felt no shame【chunk-27】, and “a man shall leave father and mother, and shall cleave to his wife”【chunk-27】.  

Because of the serpent’s craft they fell, bringing punishment and the promise of a Redeemer (the fall of the first parents)【chunk-27】.  After the fall God cast Adam out of the paradise of pleasure, placing cherubim and a flaming sword to guard the way to the tree of life【chunk-41】.
$4
