cache:query:god and man
$638
God created humans in His own image, but that image resides in the soul—a spiritual substance endowed with understanding and free will—not in the body【chunk-12】. Because man is flesh, God said His spirit will not remain in man forever and limited human lifespan to about 120 years, a reduction from the earlier long ages, to allow time for repentance before the flood【chunk-66】. The scriptures also describe God as being “touched inwardly with sorrow of heart” over humanity’s sins, a figurative way of expressing how the enormity of human wickedness led Him to decide to destroy the world with the deluge【chunk-69】.
$4
