cache:query:what is the story of adam and eve
$544
Adam was created by God as a male and female in God’s likeness (Genesis 5:1‑2)【chunk-55】. He and Eve lived naked without shame (Genesis 2:25)【chunk-27】. After they disobeyed God, the serpent’s craft brought about their fall, and they were punished and expelled from the garden. God placed cherubim and a flaming sword to guard the way to the tree of life (Genesis 3:24)【chunk-41】. Their story also includes the beginning of humanity’s lineage, leading to their children Cain and Abel (Genesis 4:1‑2)【chunk-41】.
$4
