cache:query:What is agriculture?
$440
Agriculture is the cultivation of plants and the working of the soil to produce crops and fruit, often involving tilling the earth. The text notes that before any man existed “there was not a man to till the earth” and that God commanded the earth “to bring forth green herb… and the fruit tree yielding fruit”【chunk‑18】. This describes the basic activity of planting and caring for crops, which is what agriculture entails.
$4
